WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.300
One matched pilot pair. Both runs used the
same physical arm, one after the other.

2
00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:10.450
Both saw front and wrist images and joint
readings. Only the right had Python.

3
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:15.450
Aim within 15 mm. Align the long side
within 15° of the arm’s forward axis.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:20.200
Let go and stay clear for 3 s.
The right run has drawn a grid on its image.

5
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:25.500
Could the extra calculation land the carton
closer to the same target?

6
00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:40.150
The right arm reaches toward the carton.
Its first move finishes at 2:24.

7
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:54.000
The right gripper closes on the carton.

8
00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:04.450
The right arm lifts the carton
and carries it over the tray.

9
00:01:05.875 --> 00:01:09.250
The right gripper sets the box down
and opens.

10
00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:17.100
The right run ends at 4:49.
The left arm’s first move ends at 4:50.

11
00:01:33.375 --> 00:01:37.000
The left gripper closes on the carton.

12
00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:46.000
The left arm carries it over the tray.

13
00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:48.750
The left gripper lowers the carton.

14
00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:52.475
Both pass. Center error was 3.1 mm left,
4.5 mm right.
